hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2827","Narrated to us by 'Isa bin Ibrahim Al-Ghafiqi, who said: Ibn Wahb narrated to us, informing me that Makhrama reported. [In another chain:] Narrated to us by Ibrahim bin Munqidh, who said: Ibn Wahb narrated to us, from Makhrama bin Bukayr, from his father, who said: I heard Yunus bin Yusuf, from Ibn Al-Musayyib, from 'Aisha (RA), who said: The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, """
